            "id": 144761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan atribut dan nilainya agar mengeklik link mengarahkan pemain ke halaman komunitas game.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/community&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Join the Community\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>href</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"https://example.com/community\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun tag untuk mengarahkan pemain ke halaman catatan patch.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/patch-notes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Read Patch Notes\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&lt;/</code>, diikuti oleh <code>a</code>, dan terakhir <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
